---
title: Bazinga MVP - Container Architecture
---
graph TD
    DEV([Developer])

    subgraph BZ["Bazinga"]
        WEB[Web UI]
        SERVER[Bazinga Local Server]
        QUEUE[(Job Queue<br/><i>Redis</i>)]
        WORKER[Implementation Worker<br/><i>Ephemeral container</i>]
        STATE[(State Store<br/><i>TinyDB</i>)]
    end

    REPO[(Target Project<br/><i>Filesystem</i>)]

    subgraph EXT["External Services"]
        LLM[LLM Provider]
        GITHUB[GitHub / CI]
    end

    DEV -->|Reviews diagrams, approves intent| WEB
    WEB -->|Chat, artifacts, approvals; WebSocket| SERVER
    SERVER -->|Streams responses, diagram state; WebSocket| WEB
    SERVER -->|Persists sessions and approvals| STATE
    SERVER -->|Reads repo context, writes diagrams/PRDs/roadmap| REPO
    SERVER -->|Chat, diagram, PRD generation; HTTPS| LLM
    SERVER -->|Enqueues implementation job| QUEUE
    WORKER -->|Picks up job| QUEUE
    WORKER -->|Reports job status| QUEUE
    SERVER -->|Subscribes to job status| QUEUE
    WORKER -->|Clones repo, implements PRD, pushes branch| REPO
    WORKER -.->|Creates PRs, reads checks; HTTPS| GITHUB
